MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The nvimcom package checks the version number of loaded packages. If the version number does not change, it does not update the lists of functions for omnicompletion and syntax highlight (which are stored at ~/.cache/Nvim-R/). The updating is is done when the number of loaded packages changes.

